<title>TURKEY: Turk MPs reject first graft charge against Ciller.</title>
<headline>Turk MPs reject first graft charge against Ciller.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish MPs voted against sending Deputy Prime Minister Tansu Ciller to the Supreme Court in the first of two corruption charge votes she faced on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Deputy speaker Kamer Genc announced that deputies voted 327 to 172 against impeaching Ciller for her alleged involvement in corruption at the TEDAS electricity company.</p>
</text>
